      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0003>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00030000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Look over there—do you see that mound of dirt?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F006F006B0020006F00760065007200200074006800650072006520140064006F00200079006F00750020007300650065002000740068006100740020006D006F0075006E00640020006F006600200064006900720074003F00100002011401560000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I think a wild Pokémon’s made its nest there.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020007400680069006E006B00200061002000770069006C006400200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E201900730020006D00610064006500200069007400730020006E006500730074002000740068006500720065002E00100002011401560000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The problem is, it’s preventing anyone from using\nthe Holovator...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680065002000700072006F0062006C0065006D002000690073002C00200069007420190073002000700072006500760065006E00740069006E006700200061006E0079006F006E0065002000660072006F006D0020007500730069006E0067000A00740068006500200048006F006C006F007600610074006F0072002E002E002E00100002011401560000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Could you chase that Pokémon away? I feel a little\nbad for it, but we don’t really have a choice...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Do you think you could chase away the Pokémon\nthat made its nest in front of the Holovator?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A wild Pokémon has made its nest here. Do you\nwant to battle it and chase it away?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll chase it away",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C002000630068006100730065002000690074002000610077006100790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll leave it be",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C0020006C00650061007600650020006900740020006200650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The Pokémon leaped out at you!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020006C006500610070006500640020006F0075007400200061007400200079006F007500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "DIIIIIIG!!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400490049004900490049004900470021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So that nest belonged to a Diggersby, huh?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F002000740068006100740020006E006500730074002000620065006C006F006E00670065006400200074006F002000610020004400690067006700650072007300620079002C0020006800750068003F00100002011401560000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That makes sense, actually. A Diggersby probably\ncould dig its way here from a wild zone.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Anyway, thanks for sorting that out! Now we can\nall use the Holovator!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Don’t worry about Diggersby’s hole. I filled it up\nwhile you were battling!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And now you can reach the rooftop too! It’s got a\ngreat view of the tower—check it out sometime!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
